711                        ;************************************************************************
712                        ;   WRP_FLASH
713                        ;   This routine writes one 256-byte FLASH sector.
714                        ;   Each sector will contain 84 (24-bit) words from DSP RAM (252 bytes)
715                        ;   The last 4 bytes contain a 16-bit checksum of the data
716                        ;   followed by two blank bytes.
717                        ;
718                        ;   enter with:  r2 pointing to starting PEROM Byte Address from 56309 p.o.v.
719                        ;                r0 pointing to first DSP word to save
720                        ;
721                        ;   corrupts:    r0 - points to next P:memory location to save
722                        ;                r2 - points to next P:FLASH byte address to write
723                        ;                a,b,x0
724                        ;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
725    
726                        WRP_FLASH
727       P:002042 20001B            clr     b                                 ;initialize checksum
