813                        ;---------------------------------------------------------------------------
814                        ; delay_20m --
815                        ; 20.15 ms of delay guarantees that the write cycle has finished.
816                        ;
817                        ; For Write Pulse Width High to extend 150 us requires a minimum of
818                        ; 5100 Icycles for a 33.868 MHz clock.  (29.5 ns/Icycle)
819                        ;
820                        ; the tWC is 20ms, so we just wait long enough here for the
821                        ; write cycle to have started AND finished...
