833                        ;**************************************************************************
834                        ;  this is the bootstrap loader
835                        ;  it is loaded into the P:memory at boot time.
836                        ;  After reset the external EEPROM appears as byte wide mem at P:D00000
837                        ;  This bootloader moves the user's code into 56309 pram beginning at p:0
838                        ;  and data into the X data mem beginning at x:0
